  "releaseNotes": "v1.9.0-beta: Async Streaming - Added ToAsyncEnumerable() for memory-efficient streaming of large result sets using IAsyncEnumerable<T>. Added CancellationToken support to all async methods (ToListAsync, FirstOrDefaultAsync, CountAsync, AnyAsync, AllAsync, etc.). Memory-efficient one-at-a-time entity yielding. Supports early termination and cancellation. 16 new unit tests + 5 integration tests. 211 total tests passing. v1.8.0: Existence checks with Any/All predicates. v1.7.0: Distinct() and Contains()/IN clause.",
